    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;ZhuiShu&quot; is a Chinese-style horror narrative game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A buried death. Two interwoven fates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/608f4cfe43af29bb99b8efc3c034845e.avif?t=1753247897\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Fan, a righteous police officer, receives a cryptic radio distress call during his night shift: &quot;...the mountains...save the children...&quot; The signal originates from an abandoned apartment building - official records show it was the site of a young girl's suicide years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiang Yufei, an ordinary teacher, gets drawn into the mystery after her student's inexplicable death. Each clue she uncovers pulls her deeper into a dangerous truth no one dares confront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their fates intersect across time, they must confront a cruel truth\u2014death is not the end, but the beginning of a greater conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/53277c3a4261b6400182527e3df5fd6e.poster.avif?t=1753247897\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/53277c3a4261b6400182527e3df5fd6e.webm?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/53277c3a4261b6400182527e3df5fd6e.mp4?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/36efedb6dacf12183d150bbc6a3dce99.avif?t=1753247897\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving seamlessly woven into the narrative flow creates an immersive experience that propels the story forward naturally. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meticulously crafted environments to gather clues and items, unraveling hidden truths through intuitive puzzle-solving that progresses organically with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/f3e8ec9a9314a52fc81ed6e8335e7bbe.poster.avif?t=1753247897\" width=622 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/f3e8ec9a9314a52fc81ed6e8335e7bbe.webm?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/f3e8ec9a9314a52fc81ed6e8335e7bbe.mp4?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/4d4a705cf50c77e46bdfb8a05ebe777d.poster.avif?t=1753247897\" width=622 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/4d4a705cf50c77e46bdfb8a05ebe777d.webm?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/4d4a705cf50c77e46bdfb8a05ebe777d.mp4?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/f62c180b9c2758698411b637d06ba88a.avif?t=1753247897\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Narrative</strong>: Alternate between detective Yang Fan and teacher Jiang Yufei to uncover a deliberately erased past</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Oppressive environments, eerie whispers and fragmented clues slowly reveal a suffocating truth</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True-Crime Inspired</strong>: Drawing from real cases, the game blends Eastern cultural elements with profound themes of fate, choice and human nature beneath its terrifying surface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/5cb59e6deeaf40170557215b8e1eb33e.poster.avif?t=1753247897\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/5cb59e6deeaf40170557215b8e1eb33e.webm?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/5cb59e6deeaf40170557215b8e1eb33e.mp4?t=1753247897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZhuiShu</strong>, meaning &quot;Chasing Dawn&quot; in Chinese, symbolizes the relentless pursuit of light and hope amidst overwhelming darkness. It embodies the journey of uncovering hidden truths, facing inner fears, and striving for clarity in a world shrouded in mystery.</p>",
